    "summary": "This can't be built as asked: the configurator won't let a drawer and a spike share the same corner of a cell. The drawer is fitted, but there is no spike.\n\n- **Drawer (done):** it sits on a south-facing half base at (0,0,0) and fills that half. The final build passes the checks and the parts were checked for collisions and don't clash.\n- **Spike (refused):** I added the neighbouring cells a spike needs and tried it at two corners of the drawer's cell. Both times the configurator refused it because the drawer fills that corner where the spike would stand. It offered no other positions. I removed those trial cells, so the build is just the half base and the drawer.\n\nTo get both, the spike has to go at a corner the drawer doesn't fill, or the drawer has to come off."
